msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/work-orchestration|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment"
msgid "The domain binding of the general prescription/enactment/commitment kernel onto continuing work.\n\nThe kernel is domain-neutral by construction: it is declared standalone in the reasoning namespace and takes no axiom edge into the gmeow: namespace, which is what lets one algebra serve a workflow, a DAG, a repeatable guide, a curriculum, a control plan and an organizational guide without privileging any of them. This slice is where the durable-work reading acquires its gmeow:-typed edges, and every bridge runs domain-specializes-kernel rather than the reverse.\n\nIt deliberately mints no second recommendation model: the derived frontier reaches the preference apparatus through gmeow:CandidateSet and gmeow:ComparisonContext, inheriting ties, positive incomparability and the no-context-free-winner discipline rather than reproducing them. It mints no second authority gate, no second budget and no second frontier for the same reason.\n\nThe operator review projection is honest about being a projection. Collapsing standpoint-indexed frontier classifications into one readable surface is a real loss, and it is disclosed on a projection receipt with an explicit preservation judgment rather than hidden — a review that presents coexisting disagreement as consensus would be the most consequential overclaim this surface could make."
msgstr "把通用的「规定／实施／承诺」内核绑定到持续性工作之上的领域绑定。\n\n该内核在构造上即是领域中立的：它在推理命名空间中被声明为独立自足，且不向 gmeow: 命名空间引出任何公理边——正因如此，同一套代数才能同时服务于工作流、DAG、可重复指南、课程体系、控制方案与组织规程，而不偏袒其中任何一者。本切片正是「持久性工作」这一读法取得其 gmeow: 类型化边的所在，且每一道桥都由领域方向去特化内核，而非反其道而行。\n\n它刻意不铸造第二套推荐模型：导出的前沿经由 gmeow:CandidateSet 与 gmeow:ComparisonContext 抵达偏好装置，从而承继并列、正面的不可比性，以及「不得有脱离语境之赢家」这一纪律，而不是把它们重新实现一遍。出于同样的理由，它也不铸造第二道权限闸门、第二套预算、第二个前沿。\n\n操作者复核投影对自己「只是投影」这件事是诚实的。把按立场索引的诸前沿分类塌缩为单一可读界面，是一项真实的损失；该损失记在带有明确保全判断的投影回执上，而非被掩盖——一份把并存的分歧呈现为共识的复核，将是此界面所能作出的、后果最为深重的过度主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/work-orchestration|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "GMEOW Work-Orchestration Module"
msgstr "GMEOW 工作编排模块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/work-orchestration|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The work-orchestration module — the domain binding of the prescription/enactment/commitment kernel onto continuing work: the gmeow:WorkCluster spine, versioned guidance, contribution attribution, the frontier's bindings into the preference apparatus, and the operator review projection with its disclosed preservation judgment."
msgstr "工作编排模块——把「规定／实施／承诺」内核绑定到持续性工作之上的领域绑定：gmeow:WorkCluster 骨架、经版本化的指导、贡献归属、前沿通往偏好装置的各项绑定，以及带有已披露保全判断的操作者复核投影。"
